mett","Sean Pamphilon","Royce Toni","Bradley Crumb","Alex Van Wagner","Ken Woo","Cliff Charles","Christian Hoagland","Ashraf Rijal","Aaron Phillips","Samson Chan","Tom Rome","Michael Winik","Al Francesco","Naiti Gámez","Rick Pendleton","Alastair Christopher","Charlie Grainger","Nick Bennett","Anthony Behn","Avi Grosz","Grant Babbitt","Joel Edwards","Steve Lamme","Adam Zebersky","Jonathan Furmanski","Alexandre Naufel","Brian Murray","Mike Elwell","James Fideler","Colby Gottert","Terry Stewart","Craig McKeown","Dave Svenson","Gary Johnson","Tyler Adams","David Y. Chung","Carl Burke","Cindy Lee","Thom Stukas","Jeff Alred","Wolfgang Held","Tim Newman","Vernon Rudolph","Ian Serfontein","Thorsten Thielow","Drew Xanthopoulos","Matt Staker","Michael Bonfiglio","Michael Richard Martin","Matt Bass","Terrance Stewart","Tyler McPherron","Turner Jumonville","Craig Braden","Boaz Freund","Malcolm Serrette","Charlie Askew","Jim Barry","Phil Gushue","Dave Malek","Donald Marx","Hank McElwee","Kevin Simkins","Steve Skinner","Gregg Hoerdemann","Tommy Bartlett","Andrew Didway","Doug Interrante","Thanasis Petrakis","Alex Agnant","Antonio Rossi","Kamau Bilal","Adam Benn","Ferdinand LeGrange","Ed Marritz","Jairus Davis","Phil Cho","Karsten Gopinath","Kaayla Whachell","Brian Brousseau","Jeb Bergh","Sam Robinson","David Terry Fine","Sam Jeremy Nieves","Dan Adlerstein","Jasper Cicero","Peter Winik","Ed Edwards","Keith Walker","Derek Mindler","Michael Bollacke","Mario Arredondo","Alex Garcia Rosa","Edgar Espinoza"],"composers":["Jeff Danna","Aaron Zigman","Marcelo Zarvos","Robert Miller","Chris Maxwell","Phil Hernandez","Joel Beckerman","John Loeffler","Brian Robertson","Bob Golden","Ryan Scully","David Robidoux","Tim Atack","Patrick Seymour","Chris Hayzel","Boris Zelkin","Zack Ryan","Joel Goodman","Jeff Peters","Anne Nikitin","Tony Morales","Ben Lovett","Khari Mateen","H. Scott Salinas","Goh Nakamura","Woody Pak","Dan Teicher","David Arkenstone","Paul Grimstad","Eric Liebman","Read Fasse","Patrick Hart","Michael McGinnis","Devin Smith","Leo Sidran","Eric Broucek","Conrad Sanguineti","Tom Fox","Marshall Smith","Fletcher Beasley","Michael Furjanic","Andrew Payne","Gary Arnold","Dave Schramm","Conor Szymanski","Peter Calandra","Daniel Goddard","Jonathan Griffin","David Wolfert","Daniel Belardinelli","Steve 'Silk' Hurley","Mechalie Jamison","Danny Bensi","Saunder Jurriaans","John Balcom","Gary Lionelli","Dave Porter","Jeff Cardoni","Craig Sutherland","Jonathan Camacho","Peter Nashel","Michael Hearst","JT Daly","Tom Caffey","Arian Saleh","Sam Bisbee","Nicolay","Jack Chown","Dicky","David Goulding","Zack Wright","Roger Goula","Kyle Townsend"],"reviews":[{"author":"Derek","text":"kings ransom - 3*(slabsi start, hokej je moja srdcovka a prestup waynea gretzkyho je urcite zaujimave tema, ale je to naktrutene standardne a nic nove a objavne sa tu nedozvieme),muhammad and larry - 4*(aliho navrat do ringu potom co uz nebol na vrchole a suboj proti jeho sparing partnerovy, skvele archivne zabery ako i nove rozhovory, ali bol showman a zaujimava osobnost tak dokument stoji za to),winning time - 5*(vynikajuce, toto obdobie NBA som sledoval, v skole sme hravali basketbal a kazdy poznal hracov NBA tak winning time na mna zaposobil i s nostalgickym sarmom, navyse dokument je naktruteny komedialnym stylom, plny humoru...),june, 17th 1994 - 5*(dokument nakruteny podobnym stylom ako SENNA, nedockame sa ziadnych talking heads, len archivne zabery zostrihane dohromady podporene vynikajucou hudbou... silny zazitok),two escobars - 5*(tu som trocha ovplyvneny kolumbijskou manzelkou i ked nie tak prilis lebo pribeh je to vynikajuci sam o sebe, dvaja escobari - pablo (drogovy kral) a andres (futbalovy idol) a pribeh kolumbie zo zaciatku turbulentnych 90tich rokov, ktore boli poznacene vzostupom kriminality a drog ako i kolumbijskeho narodneho timu ktory to dosiahol az na 4 miesto rebricka fifa i vdaka podpore drogovych kartelov),four days in october - 3*(baseball mam vo filmoch rad a pribeh red sox je sam o sebe vynikajuci, ale nejako ma to nechytlo za srdce, radsej si pozrem moneyball alebo major league),real rocky - 4*(slyova inspiracia k napisaniu rockyho a chuckov wepnerov zivotny pribeh od suboja s alim az po pad do drogoveho bahna, je az k neuvereniu ako rocky kopiruje chuckovu cestu zivotom),into the wind - 4*(terry fox a jeho beh napriec kanadou potom co prisiel o svoju nohu kvoli rakovine, emocialne silne i ked filmarsky priemerne... terry je vsak taka charismaticka osobnost ze to vobec nevadi),the price of gold - 4*(relativne kratka dlzka, ale zato dost zaujimave tema suboju dvoch americkych krasokorculiarskych mega hviezd a ich boju o miesto na olympijskom tyme pre zimne hry v roku 1994, skoda ze nancy kerrigan sa na dokumente nezucastnila [s touto temou nechce mat nic spolocne a odmieta sa k nej vyjadrovat] and tanya harding je dost zaujimavy charakter, nech ma na nu clovek nazor aky chce jej ucast zarukou zaujimavej diskusie...)bad boys - 4*(koniec 80tych rokov a nastup nekompromisneho tymu z detroitu. dokumentaristi dostali na kameru vsetky hlavne postavy z tohto tymu ktory bol milovany detroidcanmy a nenavideny zvyskom ameriky. pre historiu nba [hlavne toto obdobie ma bavilo] mam slabost a bad boys som si dost vychutnal [hlavne prekvapila ucast umierneneho denisa rodmana]...)big shot - 3*(lepsi z dvojice hokejovych dokumentov z prostredia nhl [druhy je kings ransom]. john spano bol multimilionar z texasu ktory sa rozhodol kupit new york islanders v polovici 90 rokov a spravit z nich opat tym ktory by nahanal superom strach. spano bol vsak mega klamar ktory nemal okrem kecov skoro ziadne peniaze a islanders dokazal ziskat len svojimy slubmy ktore nemohol a nedokazal ani splnit. skoda ze ziggy palfy stravil prave svoje najlepsie roky v islanders ktory sa zmietali v neistote a roznych problemoch inak sa jeho kariera mohla vyvyjat uplne inak...)brian and the boz - 3*(brian bosworth a jeho vrcholove obdobie na univerzite v oklahome. brian je charakter a je radost pocuvat ako si spomina na svoje roky slavy. skoda ze cely dokument je viac menej zamerany na len jeho hracsku karieru (bozov epos stone cold je spomenuty len okrajovo) a momenty s jeho synom v sklade zavanaju kalkulom a neposobia prilis presvedcivo...)jordan rides the bus - 2*(ron shelton nie je moj salok kavy a vacsinu jeho filmu povazujem za nudne, toto nie je vynimka. jordanov odchod z nba po jeho tretej vyhre bol sok a nasledna kariera v baseballe by sa dala spracovat zaujimavo, staci si pozriet netflixovsky last dance, na to vsak ron nema a co dodal je nuda. skoda)No Crossover: The Trial of Allen Iverson - 3*(ak sa vam do dokumentu nepodari dostat hlavneho protagonistu tak musite prist s niecim inym, steve james sa rozhodol pre pohlad do rasovo rozdeleneho mesta z ktoreho pochadza. je to zaujimavy napad, ale radsi by som sa dozvedel viac o sudnom procese a vsetkom okolo toho.)nature boy - 2*(tak toto reziser uplne pokaslal a to tym ze sa mu podarilo dostat pred kameru jedneho z najlepsich wrestlerov vsetkych cias, ale otazky ktore ric flairovy smerovali boli tak banalne az to bolelo. navyse si obcas pomaha i animovanymi vsuvkami, co je vacsinou barlicka ktora i ked obohacuje rozpravanie, je to najcastejsie k comu sa reziser bez riadnej vizie utiahne. strasna skoda...)(09.09.2012)méněvíce","stars":4},{"author":"scharkan","text":"xfl - vtahující. až je člověku líto, že to nevyšlo(01.03.2017)","stars":4},{"author":"Caszidy","text":"Zatím jsem měl možnost shlédnout pouze dvě části tohoto sportovně dokumentárního cyklu, konkrétně Winning Time: Reggie Miller vs. The New York Knicks a No Crossover: The Trial of Allen Iverson, tudíž hodnotím je a jejich kvalita je skvělá!(14.10.2010)","stars":4}],"vods":[{"platform":"Disney+","url":"https://srv.tunefindforfans.com/showads/track/srvclk.php?aid=100006796&lp=https%3A//www.disneyplus.com/en-cz/browse/entity-ec0d17fb-e214-44c7-af38-62cd192af0d4"},{"platform":"Oneplay","url":"https://www.oneplay.cz/porad/232527-ac-milan-berlusconiho-vitezstvi"}],"link":"https://www.csfd.cz/film/282646-30-for-30/prehled/","csfd_id":282646,"root_id":282646,"root_title_id":null,"root_title":null,"root_slug":null,"is_toplevel":true,"season_no":null,"episode_no":null,"season_count":5,"episode_count":141,"is_running":false,"cadence_days":null,"first_vod_date":null,"last_vod_date":null,"episodes":[{"season_no":1,"episode_no":4,"vod_date":null,"title":"Muhammad a Larry (S01E04)","platforms":["Disney+"]},{"season_no":2,"episode_no":18,"vod_date":null,"title":"Bad Boys (S02E18)","platforms":["Disney+"]},{"season_no":4,"episode_no":8,"vod_date":null,"title":"Long Gone Summer (S04E08)","platforms":["Disney+"]},{"season_no":5,"episode_no":9,"vod_date":null,"title":"AC Milán: Berlusconiho vítězství (S05E09)","platforms":["Oneplay"]}]}